 /*
+ * Surface Pro 7 IR camera (OV7251, CSI-2 index 1 = source 6, one lane) needs
+ * the same shifted data-lane timing as the front camera: Windows'
+ * data_ticks = 1360 - 32000 / F_MHz, 1269 at 350 MHz. From surface-kit's
